cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ECCE, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ECCE: Extensible Computational Chemistry Environment"
abstract: >-
  A graphical environment for computational chemistry: build molecules,
  set up calculations for NWChem, Gaussian, ORCA, MOPAC and a built-in
  Hartree-Fock/DFT engine, run them on a workstation or a cluster, keep
  them in a managed store, and view the results. Originally developed at
  Pacific Northwest National Laboratory.
